@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Application health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### First page: the fixed demo scope includes site-a and site-b
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?limit=20
Accept: application/json

### Filtered first page (eight matching fixtures, so limit 3 exercises pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?siteId=site-a&severity=HIGH&limit=3
Accept: application/json

### Continuation: copy nextCursor from the filtered response and keep its filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?siteId=site-a&severity=HIGH&limit=3&cursor=PASTE_NEXT_CURSOR_HERE
Accept: application/json

### Forbidden site
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?siteId=site-c

### Invalid limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?limit=101
